depending on how you look at it. However, if you don't mind the inconsistencies and focus mainly on the captivating story, then this game is easily a
. It's a solid port for an amazing series and that's something all fans should be thankful for. After having waited for this remaster to come out for a while, I can safely say that it was well worth the wait.
